# Build-context hygiene. `apps/`, `packages/` (including
# packages/persistence/drizzle/ migration SQL + meta/) and the Dockerfile MUST
# stay in the context; everything excluded here is noise for the image build.
#
# NB: do NOT ignore `drizzle` — Docker matches it at any depth and it would drop
# packages/persistence/drizzle/, breaking the pre-deploy `npm run db:migrate`.
node_modules
.git
.gitignore
.next
dist
coverage
*.tsbuildinfo
.env*
!.env.example
.DS_Store
.idea
.vscode
docs
samples
schemas
references
*.md
.github
infra
.terraform
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfvars
